    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton resource manager for loading and caching assets. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classResourceManager" kindref="compound">ResourceManager</ref> provides a centralized system for loading and caching assets such as textures and shaders. It ensures that each asset is loaded only once and shared across the engine, reducing memory usage and load times.</para>
<para>Supported assets: textures and shaders.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This is a singleton; use <ref refid="classResourceManager_1a98b11a6302bf0db4ffc81eea70512ee2" kindref="member">GetInstance()</ref> to access it. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classTexture2D" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref>, <ref refid="classShader" kindref="compound">Shader</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
